Rep. Roberto Nazal: Then Madam Chair, can DBM kadilis?

1598
02:32:26,880 --> 02:32:37,940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: DBM kategorikali confirm that public interest under Section 78 cannot be used to withhold the initial release of an allotment.

1599
02:32:51,780 --> 02:32:54,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, yes, the category...

1600
02:32:54,440 --> 02:32:55,700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: My apologies, yes and no.

1601
02:32:55,820 --> 02:32:56,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Medyo confusing po.

1602
02:32:56,600 --> 02:33:00,560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The categorical answer of DBM is no.

1603
02:33:01,260 --> 02:33:04,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hindi po pwedeng gamitin ito para mag-hold ng releases.

1604
