1690
02:41:21,340 --> 02:41:39,080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker. Given that whichever was included in either the HGAB or the SGAB or the BICAM that was not there in the NEPFOS under new budgetary items or increases in appropriations, the same section holds po. So it is possible.

1691
02:41:39,580 --> 02:41:41,980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, kung hindi po natin tatanggal,

1692
02:41:42,000 --> 02:41:48,720
