Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: maapektuhan po kasi yung essentially marami pong mga projects and programs and activities na madi-disallow kung dalesyo po tayo sa veto.

1700
02:43:22,520 --> 02:43:27,560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So ang ginawa nilang po as a safeguard, sinubject nilang po doon sa iba't ibang mga kondisyon.

1701
02:43:28,140 --> 02:43:38,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So if straight to veto po kasi, ang mangyayari matatanggal po lahat sila so that would affect economic growth and government expenditure.

1702
02:43:38,620 --> 02:43:41,620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi po ba pwede, Madam Chair, na very...

1703
02:43:42,000 --> 02:43:45,780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Like you mentioned, very specific naman yung veto message.

1704
02:43:46,180 --> 02:43:52,940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It can be very specific where kung ano yung ayaw ng Presidente na provision, yun lang ang i-veto niya.

1705
02:43:59,820 --> 02:44:05,480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And may I ask, bakit nyo po sinasabing maapektuhan ng economic growth?

1706
02:44:05,480 --> 02:44:11,780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi parang ang sinasabi nyo, effectively, by saying that this will affect economic growth,

1707
