Rep. Roberto Nazal: interest na

1715
02:45:01,860 --> 02:45:03,960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: provision, ay pwede pong

1716
02:45:03,960 --> 02:45:06,200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: gamitin yung pera

1717
02:45:06,200 --> 02:45:07,780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at ilipat sa ibang

1718
02:45:07,780 --> 02:45:09,420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: mga proyekto.

1719
02:45:15,480 --> 02:45:16,800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May time, please.

1720
02:45:18,460 --> 02:45:19,220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pakitigil.

1721
02:46:43,200 --> 02:46:59,980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, actually po kahit wala po itong provision na 'to, kahit wala po itong general provision na 'to, the President has the power vested by the Constitution to use savings.

1722
02:47:00,000 --> 02:47:01,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Under Section 25,

1723
02:47:02,620 --> 02:47:04,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Subsection 5,

1724
