02:47:09,580 --> 02:47:11,280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: authorizing any transfer

1728
02:47:11,280 --> 02:47:13,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of appropriations. However,

1729
02:47:13,880 --> 02:47:15,860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the President, the President of the Senate,

1730
02:47:15,980 --> 02:47:17,860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the Speaker of the House of Representatives, the Chief

1731
