Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Talagang may identified lang po talaga na qualified barangays na pwede sa NTF-ELCAC.

4688
05:41:26,480 --> 05:41:31,400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For the Growth Equity Fund, it's limited to 4th and 5th class municipalities

4689
05:41:31,400 --> 05:41:37,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: who may have deficits even after the NTA allotment is provided.

4690
05:41:37,060 --> 05:41:49,460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, actually po, the disbursement of the LGSF is actually governed by the special provision on LGSF.

4691
05:41:49,860 --> 05:41:57,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, every Ga'a po, actually, posibleng magpalit yung menu ng Falgo, for example.

4692
05:41:57,320 --> 05:42:02,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But for NTF-ELCAC and for Growth Equity Fund, may intended use po talaga sila.

4693
05:42:02,720 --> 05:42:08,560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, as much as this representation would like to put trust

4694
05:42:08,560 --> 05:42:19,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on the implementation of supposedly these standards, these mechanisms that should check whether the funding for specific local projects

4695
05:42:19,860 --> 05:42:31,520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: are followed, we have on record a discussion, an admission from a Secretary for last year when I asked during the

4696
