Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: discussions on the Department of Agriculture's budget proposal in 2026, this good Secretary admitted that

4697
05:42:40,100 --> 05:42:49,080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even though there's already a national plan for farm-to-market roads, it is still the congressmen who dictate which roads will be built

4698
05:42:49,080 --> 05:42:49,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: depending on whose lobbying will be granted.

4699
