Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: they can differ, that there could be special provisions in different types of fundings,

4702
05:43:11,120 --> 05:43:19,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: whether that be LGSF or NTF-ELCAC, which I will go to a bit later, how do we ensure that these standards are met?

4703
05:43:19,840 --> 05:43:27,600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: given that there are admissions from our members of different agencies that they're not really followed?

4704
05:43:27,860 --> 05:43:29,040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, good sponsor.

4705
05:43:34,720 --> 05:43:43,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, in the case of LGSF, for example, Falgo, it is highly dependent on the LGUs.

4706
05:43:43,840 --> 05:43:49,800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, it really depends on which LGUs submit project proposals into the portal.

4707
05:43:49,800 --> 05:43:58,180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, the evaluation and the determination as to which LGUs would receive projects

4708
