Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: is solely at the discretion of the DBM based on specific criteria and evaluation requirements.

4709
05:44:05,980 --> 05:44:17,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, pagdating po sa LGSF, actually, wala po talaga, aside from Congress laying out which menu items would be allowable for that year,

4710
05:44:17,920 --> 05:44:24,900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: it's really in the purview of DBM to receive proposals from the local government units

4711
05:44:24,900 --> 05:44:28,220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and to evaluate them and ultimately determine which projects will be funded.

4712
05:44:29,220 --> 05:44:32,920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, is the answer, Madam Speaker, that at least for LGSF,

4713
