Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and approve certain projects.

4715
05:44:45,200 --> 05:44:54,240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: After the lump sum is granted, but that's only for LGSF, in particular, Madam Speaker.

4716
05:44:55,240 --> 05:44:59,980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Particularly po for LGSF Falgo, based on the menu and

4717
05:45:00,000 --> 05:45:02,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: put forth, set forth

4718
05:45:02,540 --> 05:45:04,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the GAA as well as the criteria

4719
05:45:04,740 --> 05:45:05,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for evaluation.

4720
05:45:06,800 --> 05:45:08,840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Speaker, I'd like to

4721
05:45:08,840 --> 05:45:10,480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: relate to

4722
05:45:10,480 --> 05:45:12,680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and LGSF also

4723
05:45:12,680 --> 05:45:14,700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nabanggit na nakalign item

