Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang funds para sa Barangay Development

4725
05:45:16,740 --> 05:45:18,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Program or BDP

4726
05:45:18,620 --> 05:45:20,880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng NTF-ELCAC. Tama po ba

