Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as an annex in the

4732
05:45:47,260 --> 05:45:49,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: NEP and also in the

4733
05:45:49,000 --> 05:45:50,860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: HGAB is the list of

