5770
07:30:17,360 --> 07:30:19,860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, would the distinguished sponsor also confirm

5771
07:30:19,860 --> 07:30:23,880
Rep. JC M. Abalos: that for year 2024 when the POPCEN CBMS was conducted,

