Rep. JC M. Abalos: So nais ko po malaman, Madam Chair,

5776
07:31:03,300 --> 07:31:05,660
Rep. JC M. Abalos: mula nung naisabatas ang CBMS,

5777
07:31:05,920 --> 07:31:10,860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: magkano na po ang total appropriations na ininvest ng ating pamahalaan sa CBMS?

5778
07:31:28,200 --> 07:31:32,740
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, perhaps we could stop my time as we wait for the response from the sponsor.

5779
07:31:38,240 --> 07:31:39,000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

5780
07:31:39,640 --> 07:31:42,000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then from 2024...

5781
07:32:52,500 --> 07:33:14,120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, so from 2019 to 2023, given that we were only doing pilot programs for the CBMS, 500 million po yung inallocate natin for the CBMS.

5782
07:33:14,120 --> 07:33:31,060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then for 2024, mayroon na pong 5 billion kasi full-fledged na po yung pag-implement because it was a census year. We conducted the census in 2024, so for 2025 and 2026, again 500 million annually.

5783
07:33:31,080 --> 07:33:38,140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then for 2027, since we're also conducting the census for 2027, 5 billion din po ang i-allocate.

5784
07:33:38,680 --> 07:33:43,140
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Maraming salamat po, distinguished sponsor. So, uulitin ko lang po, Madam Speaker.

5785
07:33:43,740 --> 07:33:50,380
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kung sakaling papayagan po natin na bigyan muli ng mahigit 5 bilyong piso ang CBMS,

5786
07:33:50,860 --> 07:34:00,680
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ang ibig sabihin ito, mula nung naisabatas ang CBMS, magkakaroon po tayo ng more than 10 billion pesos that will be allocated to the CBMS.

5787
07:34:00,680 --> 07:34:05,020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Just one thing I want to make clear here, Madam Speaker. Hindi po ako tutol sa CBMS.

5788
07:34:05,140 --> 07:34:07,320
Rep. JC M. Abalos: As a matter of fact, I fully support it.

5789
07:34:07,980 --> 07:34:15,380
Rep. JC M. Abalos: When the CBMS Act was enacted into law, I thought that this would be a time wherein this would usher a new era

5790
07:34:15,380 --> 07:34:20,540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung saan meron po tayong data-driven at evidence-based governance.

5791
07:34:21,120 --> 07:34:28,960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kaya nga po mula naging membro ako ng Kongreso, taon-taon, parating ko po tinatanong kung ano yung mga nagiging accomplishment ng CBMS

5792
07:34:28,960 --> 07:34:36,020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: dahil nagsisilbi po itong gabay, hindi lamang sa LGU, kung hindi, sa bawat ahensya po ng pamahalaan.

5793
07:34:36,420 --> 07:34:46,600
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ngayon, ngayong nalaman po natin ang potential investment natin sa CBMS, gusto ko po malaman, Madam Speaker, kung ano ang nakuha natin kapalit nito.

5794
07:34:47,140 --> 07:34:55,940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Uulitin ko po, Madam Speaker, we've spent more than 5 billion pesos for the CBMS and we're looking to invest 5 billion pesos more.

5795
07:34:55,940 --> 07:34:58,940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: It's very important for us to know kung ano ang kabalitan.

5796
07:34:58,960 --> 07:35:02,220
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kung ano ang buoang investment na makukuha natin kapalit nito.

5797
07:35:04,140 --> 07:35:12,280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Unang-una, Madam Speaker, importante ang CBMS dahil hindi nakuhulaan ng gobyerno kung saan ang kahirapan.

5798
07:35:13,060 --> 07:35:16,260
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Hindi na kanyang-kanyang listahan ang bawat ahensya.

5799
07:35:16,960 --> 07:35:24,860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Hindi na dapat may hiwalay na listahan ang DSWD, ang ibang departamento, at ibang listahan ng LGU na hindi nagtutugma.

5800
07:35:24,860 --> 07:35:28,860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kaya po ipinasa ang CBMS Act para magkaroon tayo ng ehem.

5801
07:35:28,960 --> 07:35:37,940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Updated, disaggregated, household level information na maaaring gamitin ng national government at local government

5802
07:35:37,940 --> 07:35:46,060
Rep. JC M. Abalos: para malaman natin sino sa ating populasyon, sino sa pamayanan ang nangangailangan, nasaan sila, ano ang kailangan nila,

5803
07:35:46,540 --> 07:35:50,940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: at saan dapat mapunta ang limitadong pondo ng gobyerno.

5804
07:35:50,940 --> 07:35:58,040
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And after all these years, and after all these billions allocated, magandang malaman po natin, Madam Speaker,

5805
07:35:58,220 --> 07:35:58,940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kung na-deliverance.

5806
07:35:58,960 --> 07:36:01,280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Mag-deliver ba natin ang pangakong yun?

5807
07:36:02,020 --> 07:36:07,400
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, as I've said, taon-taon po natin sinusubaybayan ang CBMS.

5808
07:36:07,560 --> 07:36:14,500
Rep. JC M. Abalos: As a matter of fact, during the deliberations for the 2025 budget, if my recollection is correct,

5809
07:36:15,340 --> 07:36:26,340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: the PSA said, on the plenary, as we were deliberating its budget, noong 2025, 70% completed ang CBMS.

5810
07:36:26,340 --> 07:36:30,520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And during that time, they even provided us original targets.

5811
07:36:30,620 --> 07:36:32,840
Rep. JC M. Abalos: This is all on the record, Madam Speaker.

5812
07:36:33,340 --> 07:36:37,640
Rep. JC M. Abalos: They said, October or December 2024, tatapusin na nila.

5813
07:36:38,160 --> 07:36:40,020
