Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

6995
08:49:09,100 --> 08:49:09,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: All right.

6996
08:49:10,380 --> 08:49:10,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige.

6997
08:49:11,240 --> 08:49:12,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ready na.

6998
08:49:12,020 --> 08:49:13,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The next...

6999
08:49:13,780 --> 08:49:14,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next...

7000
08:49:15,640 --> 08:49:19,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide po.

7001
08:49:19,620 --> 08:49:20,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Next slide.

7002
08:49:20,980 --> 08:49:21,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tubos oras natin.

7003
08:49:22,480 --> 08:49:22,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7004
08:49:23,760 --> 08:49:37,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, historically, if I may, if we go by yung kasaysayan ng budget, historically, nangyayari yun.

7005
08:49:38,620 --> 08:49:38,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7006
08:49:38,780 --> 08:49:41,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: From the NEP, no?

7007
08:49:41,620 --> 08:49:48,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Biglang magpapasok ng mga proyekto, particular for infrastructure.

7008
08:49:49,400 --> 08:49:50,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That happened.

7009
08:49:51,160 --> 08:49:56,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, from the NEP, you get the approved general appropriations bill.

7010
08:49:56,860 --> 08:50:00,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And there, yung mga deficiencies na sinabi natin, mapupunuan yan.

7011
08:50:01,860 --> 08:50:03,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, historically, nangyayari yun.

7012
08:50:04,060 --> 08:50:05,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, in order to be able to do that,

7013
08:50:05,780 --> 08:50:11,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in order to be able to do that, alam naman natin, since there's a fixed ceiling,

7014
08:50:11,620 --> 08:50:13,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: on the budget, diba?

7015
08:50:13,400 --> 08:50:15,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In this case, it's 7.2 trillion.

7016
08:50:16,720 --> 08:50:17,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kailangan may pagkunan.

7017
08:50:18,120 --> 08:50:21,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para madagdagan mo yung DPWH, kailangan may bawasan ka from somewhere.

7018
08:50:22,920 --> 08:50:23,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

7019
08:50:23,980 --> 08:50:25,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, what does this table show?

7020
08:50:25,600 --> 08:50:33,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This table shows, historically, saan yung mga pinakalaking, malaking binawasan?

7021
08:50:34,360 --> 08:50:35,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para makapagdagdag.

7022
08:50:36,620 --> 08:50:36,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

7023
08:50:38,120 --> 08:50:40,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Informally, this is referred to as source.

7024
08:50:40,560 --> 08:50:41,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano yung ginagawang source?

7025
08:50:41,620 --> 08:50:42,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Source ng funding.

7026
08:50:43,020 --> 08:50:44,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, that's incorrect, no?

7027
08:50:44,860 --> 08:50:45,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, source.

7028
08:50:46,240 --> 08:50:57,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, pakita natin, historically, ang isang favorite source ng Kongreso ay the DOTR, Foreign Assisted Project.

7029
08:50:58,840 --> 08:51:02,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And, of course, DepDEP may kinalaman kasi silang nag-a-approve dyan, eh.

7030
08:51:02,560 --> 08:51:02,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama ba?

7031
08:51:03,840 --> 08:51:08,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga flagship DOTR projects.

7032
08:51:08,500 --> 08:51:11,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: San yung may kinalaman sa DepDEP yung tanong ko?

7033
08:51:11,620 --> 08:51:11,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

7034
08:51:12,500 --> 08:51:15,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nakita po natin dito.

7035
08:51:16,140 --> 08:51:19,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, again, you will notice a pattern.

7036
08:51:20,280 --> 08:51:22,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In 2016, we only went back as far as 2016.

7037
08:51:24,460 --> 08:51:33,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakita natin nun, ang kalakaran, kung ano yung pinroposed na DOTR, Foreign Assisted Project, yun din ang in-approve ng Kongreso sa GAA.

7038
08:51:33,380 --> 08:51:33,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

7039
08:51:34,120 --> 08:51:34,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7040
08:51:34,380 --> 08:51:35,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2016, that was the case.

7041
08:51:36,340 --> 08:51:36,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2017.

7042
08:51:38,700 --> 08:51:39,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2018.

7043
08:51:39,340 --> 08:51:43,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Medyo, dito na nagsimula yung pattern.

7044
08:51:44,580 --> 08:51:49,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May pinroposed, tapos, kalahati lang ang in-approve sa GAA.

7045
08:51:50,900 --> 08:51:51,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7046
08:51:51,120 --> 08:51:59,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But then, we see that pattern on a larger scale, no?

7047
08:51:59,500 --> 08:52:02,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Starting 2020 up to 2026.

7048
08:52:02,900 --> 08:52:04,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano po nakita natin?

7049
08:52:05,220 --> 08:52:07,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Partikular sa DOTR, Foreign Assisted Projects.

7050
08:52:08,020 --> 08:52:09,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga DOTR, Foreign Assisted Projects.

7051
08:52:09,340 --> 08:52:15,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan yung mga railway, North-North-South Railway, Subway, and so on.

7052
08:52:15,620 --> 08:52:15,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

7053
08:52:15,860 --> 08:52:17,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mga mainly, these are rail projects.

7054
08:52:18,280 --> 08:52:19,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano nangyari?

7055
08:52:19,480 --> 08:52:22,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Starting, especially in 2020, as you can see.

7056
08:52:23,120 --> 08:52:23,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7057
08:52:27,000 --> 08:52:27,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan.

7058
08:52:28,140 --> 08:52:28,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakita nyo.

7059
08:52:29,060 --> 08:52:32,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2020, the proposed was 101 billion.

7060
08:52:33,620 --> 08:52:38,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, the approved was only, was 46% below the proposal.

7061
08:52:38,360 --> 08:52:38,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

7062
08:52:39,340 --> 08:52:45,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, if you go to the 2024, talagang ito yung pinaka-extreme.

7063
08:52:46,720 --> 08:52:51,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito rin yung, it's no coincidence, ito rin yung may pinakamalaking flood control.

7064
08:52:52,220 --> 08:52:55,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At may pinakamalaking dagdag sa ayuda.

7065
08:52:56,420 --> 08:52:57,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung pinakita ko kanina, no?

7066
08:52:57,820 --> 08:52:58,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, tignan nyo.

7067
08:52:59,100 --> 08:53:03,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang proposed for Foreign Assisted Projects was 161 billion.

7068
08:53:04,100 --> 08:53:08,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang in-approved was only 3.5 billion.

7069
08:53:08,760 --> 08:53:08,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7070
08:53:08,820 --> 08:53:11,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang in-approved was only 98% below the proposal.

7071
08:53:12,840 --> 08:53:13,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

7072
08:53:14,780 --> 08:53:15,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7073
08:53:15,320 --> 08:53:16,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ganun ang pattern.

7074
08:53:16,360 --> 08:53:20,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, I ask this because in 2027, malaki.

7075
08:53:20,780 --> 08:53:24,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napakalaki nung, napakalaki nung Foreign Assisted.

7076
08:53:26,400 --> 08:53:27,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 232 billion.

7077
08:53:27,720 --> 08:53:30,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, my question is, will this happen again?

7078
08:53:31,580 --> 08:53:31,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7079
08:53:31,700 --> 08:53:37,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang laki-laki ng pinroposed for DOTR, DOTR Foreign Assisted Projects.

7080
08:53:37,700 --> 08:53:42,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos sa GAA, 2% lang pala yung ma-approve.

7081
08:53:43,380 --> 08:53:43,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7082
08:53:43,940 --> 08:53:46,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, anong epekto pagka ganun?

7083
08:53:47,520 --> 08:53:51,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa DepDev, ano yung epekto pagka ganun ang ginagawa ng Kongreso?

7084
08:53:53,680 --> 08:53:58,700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, going back to what was mentioned a while ago,

7085
08:53:59,080 --> 08:54:02,400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: given the delays in public infrastructure spending,

7086
08:54:02,400 --> 08:54:05,900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: if we implemented those in a timely manner,

7087
08:54:06,040 --> 08:54:07,080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: we would have grown.

7088
08:54:07,700 --> 08:54:09,240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: One percentage point higher.

7089
08:54:09,760 --> 08:54:14,120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, that's one estimate that the DepDev has.

7090
08:54:15,380 --> 08:54:18,360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But in terms of the DOTR projects,

7091
08:54:19,680 --> 08:54:22,900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: like the DepDev only has purview over the IFPs.

7092
08:54:23,880 --> 08:54:27,900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, there are 60 IFPs for DOTR.

7093
08:54:28,900 --> 08:54:31,020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: If it's okay with our distinguished colleague,

7094
08:54:31,100 --> 08:54:34,940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: we can give a copy as well as the status of these projects.

7095
08:54:35,600 --> 08:54:37,620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Or I can enumerate if we're good.

7096
08:54:37,700 --> 08:54:39,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: If my colleague wants.

7097
08:54:40,080 --> 08:54:40,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7098
08:54:40,960 --> 08:54:41,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I am told...

7099
08:54:42,700 --> 08:54:44,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam Chair, baka pwedeng...

7100
08:54:45,260 --> 08:54:50,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May tanong lang po ako sa regarding the parliamentary status.

7101
08:54:53,100 --> 08:54:55,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: If I may ask first,

7102
08:54:55,960 --> 08:54:57,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pwede mo matigil lang po yung oras?

7103
08:55:01,000 --> 08:55:02,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayaw, itigil yung oras.

7104
08:55:03,100 --> 08:55:07,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No, I am told that now the interpolation will include both...

7105
08:55:07,700 --> 08:55:10,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: DepDev and DBM?

7106
08:55:11,140 --> 08:55:11,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ganun po ba yun?

7107
08:55:15,140 --> 08:55:15,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7108
08:55:15,700 --> 08:55:15,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O hindi.

7109
08:55:16,480 --> 08:55:19,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: You are not defending DBM budget.

7110
08:55:19,980 --> 08:55:20,960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just the DepDev budget.

7111
08:55:21,020 --> 08:55:21,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, DepDev budget.

7112
08:55:22,100 --> 08:55:22,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, it's clear.

7113
08:55:22,900 --> 08:55:23,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

7114
08:55:23,620 --> 08:55:24,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

7115
08:55:24,720 --> 08:55:24,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alright.

7116
08:55:25,680 --> 08:55:25,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alright.

7117
08:55:26,240 --> 08:55:28,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano po nangyayari?

7118
08:55:28,140 --> 08:55:30,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, obviously, pagka hindi pinunduhan,

7119
08:55:30,680 --> 08:55:33,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi ma-implement.

7120
08:55:33,280 --> 08:55:33,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

7121
08:55:34,780 --> 08:55:35,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7122
08:55:36,240 --> 08:55:36,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However,

7123
08:55:36,480 --> 08:55:38,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron akong question dyan

7124
08:55:38,480 --> 08:55:38,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: because

7125
08:55:38,980 --> 08:55:41,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in the NEP,

7126
08:55:42,360 --> 08:55:44,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga foreign-assisted projects na ganyan,

7127
08:55:45,800 --> 08:55:47,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: they are tied to specific loans.

7128
08:55:48,320 --> 08:55:48,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

7129
08:55:49,060 --> 08:55:50,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Perfected loans.

7130
08:55:50,500 --> 08:55:50,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

7131
08:55:52,380 --> 08:55:52,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Correct?

7132
08:55:53,020 --> 08:55:53,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

7133
08:55:55,420 --> 08:55:56,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung nasa NEP,

7134
08:55:57,640 --> 08:55:59,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na foreign-assisted project ng DOTR,

7135
08:56:00,600 --> 08:56:03,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron ng loan agreement yun.

7136
08:56:04,320 --> 08:56:04,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama?

7137
08:56:04,480 --> 08:56:05,040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Tama?

7138
08:56:06,480 --> 08:56:09,380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Not all projects, Madam Speaker.

7139
08:56:10,540 --> 08:56:18,180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But most IFPs for foreign-assisted would be tied to official development assistance loans.

7140
08:56:18,480 --> 08:56:22,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, as a general rule, yung nilalagay sa NEP, yun ay yung meron ng loan na.

7141
08:56:22,600 --> 08:56:23,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sigurado na, nandyan na.

7142
08:56:23,720 --> 08:56:27,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi yung mag-ne-negotiate pa lang kami, lalagay na namin sa NEP.

7143
08:56:27,520 --> 08:56:28,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba? Hindi ganon?

7144
08:56:28,800 --> 08:56:29,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

7145
08:56:29,280 --> 08:56:30,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nando na yung loan.

7146
08:56:30,240 --> 08:56:30,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7147
08:56:31,300 --> 08:56:33,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, however, my question now is,

7148
08:56:33,540 --> 08:56:35,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagka ginawa yan ng Kongreso,

7149
08:56:36,480 --> 08:56:41,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: proposal was 151 billion,

7150
08:56:42,500 --> 08:56:46,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and then the approved in the GAA was only a fraction of that,

7151
08:56:46,640 --> 08:56:47,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2% of that.

7152
08:56:49,740 --> 08:56:53,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang tanyari, shouldn't that then, dahil natanggal na yung...

7153
08:56:54,100 --> 08:56:59,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The effect there is that the source of funding is no longer available, correct?

7154
08:57:01,300 --> 08:57:02,120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

7155
08:57:02,120 --> 08:57:02,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In other words,

7156
08:57:03,540 --> 08:57:06,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Congress cannot use the...

7157
08:57:06,480 --> 08:57:13,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The freed up, let's call that freed up fiscal space, yun ba ang tawag doon?

7158
08:57:14,420 --> 08:57:14,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7159
08:57:16,220 --> 08:57:17,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: To fund other projects.

7160
08:57:18,000 --> 08:57:18,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba hindi pwede yun?

7161
08:57:19,640 --> 08:57:20,260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: No, Madam Speaker.

7162
08:57:20,360 --> 08:57:21,200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Hindi pwede, di ba?

7163
08:57:21,320 --> 08:57:28,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nasabi natin, teka, 150 dapat sa foreign assisted, pero ginawasan natin ng 140.

7164
08:57:29,560 --> 08:57:33,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Therefore, we have freed up 140 for other projects.

7165
08:57:33,900 --> 08:57:34,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba hindi pwede yun?

7166
08:57:35,860 --> 08:57:36,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No.

7167
08:57:36,480 --> 08:57:37,060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: No, Madam Speaker.

7168
08:57:37,080 --> 08:57:37,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pwede.

7169
08:57:37,700 --> 08:57:39,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Eh, pero yun ang ginagawa ng Kongreso all the time.

7170
08:57:41,440 --> 08:57:42,300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba may mali doon?

7171
08:57:43,560 --> 08:57:44,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, in other words,

7172
08:57:44,420 --> 08:57:53,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: if when Congress, or if Congress specifically reduces the appropriation for

7173
08:57:53,160 --> 08:57:58,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: foreign assisted projects with perfected loan agreements,

7174
08:57:59,780 --> 08:58:04,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pagka binawasan yun ng Kongreso, in terms of pag hindi inappropriate yun ng Kongreso,

7175
08:58:05,280 --> 08:58:06,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: then that should...

7176
08:58:06,480 --> 08:58:09,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: reduce the total budget.

7177
08:58:10,180 --> 08:58:18,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung baga, yung, kunyari, 7.2, dapat kung binawasan mo ng 100B na foreign assisted,

7178
08:58:18,780 --> 08:58:21,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dapat 7.1 na lang ang ceiling.

7179
08:58:21,460 --> 08:58:23,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi ba ganun dapat ang epekto nun?

7180
08:58:24,040 --> 08:58:24,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: You get my point?

7181
08:58:25,840 --> 08:58:28,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Madam, correct?

7182
08:58:30,000 --> 08:58:33,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Could you please place that on the record?

7183
08:58:35,100 --> 08:58:36,280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, Madam Speaker,

7184
08:58:36,480 --> 08:58:39,240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: if it's in the GAA,

7185
08:58:39,480 --> 08:58:42,360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: then it should be,

7186
08:58:42,920 --> 08:58:46,080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the funding for that particular project is,

7187
08:58:46,340 --> 08:58:48,420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: for that particular project, you can't modify.

7188
08:58:49,100 --> 08:58:52,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, I think what I'm pointing out is, in fact,

7189
08:58:52,340 --> 08:58:53,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that ganun nga nangyayari, no?

7190
08:58:54,300 --> 08:58:56,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I mean, for many years,

7191
08:58:57,360 --> 08:58:59,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ginagawa ng Kongreso, binabawasan ng malaki

7192
08:58:59,980 --> 08:59:03,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung DOTR, foreign assisted projects,

7193
08:59:03,520 --> 08:59:06,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and these are specifically,

7194
08:59:06,180 --> 08:59:08,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tied to a source, the loan,

7195
08:59:10,620 --> 08:59:17,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tapos, the freed up space is used for, you know,

7196
08:59:17,780 --> 08:59:21,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for insertion, congressional insertion.

7197
08:59:22,100 --> 08:59:24,460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung mga proyektong dinadagdag.

7198
08:59:26,060 --> 08:59:27,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, specifically,

7199
08:59:28,160 --> 08:59:33,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pinakamalala yan nung years 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025.

7200
08:59:34,060 --> 08:59:35,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan din yung panahon na pinakamalala,

7201
08:59:35,820 --> 08:59:37,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung flood control

7202
08:59:37,980 --> 08:59:39,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: insertions, diba?

7203
08:59:40,660 --> 08:59:41,480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun ang point ko.

7204
08:59:41,840 --> 08:59:44,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. That is the point

7205
08:59:44,100 --> 08:59:45,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I'm making. And now,

7206
08:59:45,920 --> 08:59:47,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the question I am asking

7207
08:59:47,280 --> 08:59:50,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: this Congress is, gagawin na naman ba yun

7208
08:59:50,220 --> 08:59:52,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng Kongresong ito?

7209
08:59:54,760 --> 08:59:56,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede pa bang gawin yun ng Kongresong ito?

7210
09:00:00,000 --> 09:00:04,140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, Madam Speaker, well, not pertaining to the budget of the DepDev.

7211
09:00:04,400 --> 09:00:10,000
