Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, and so on.

7237
09:02:14,380 --> 09:02:18,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Again, ang pinakamalala, no?

7238
09:02:18,400 --> 09:02:24,140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, kailangan matalasa kay Saisaya na ang pinakamalalang mga abuso sa budget, 2024.

7239
09:02:25,140 --> 09:02:26,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

7240
09:02:27,680 --> 09:02:36,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, MPBF then was 135, but approved in GAA is 29 billion.

7241
09:02:37,340 --> 09:02:38,500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 29 billion.

7242
09:02:39,180 --> 09:02:39,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

7243
09:02:40,000 --> 09:02:41,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ano nangyari doon sa pondo na yun?

7244
