Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As you can see, the 2027 proposed is 55 billion.

7258
09:03:22,740 --> 09:03:24,220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: A little over 55 billion.

7259
09:03:24,220 --> 09:03:25,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mamaya.

7260
09:03:26,560 --> 09:03:27,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala yata yung...

7261
