Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala.

7262
09:03:27,680 --> 09:03:28,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala pa yung DBM.

7263
09:03:28,480 --> 09:03:29,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Babalik sila.

7264
09:03:30,160 --> 09:03:33,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But isang tinututukan natin dito yung ano eh.

7265
