7549
09:27:11,700 --> 09:27:15,040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: We know for a fact, because we were there, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7550
09:27:42,500 --> 09:28:22,400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, Madam Speaker, we understand the concern. Definitely, we share the same concern of the Honorable San Fernando. If it would be beneficial, I think the best course of action, at least at this point in time, there is a list of people who supposedly attended the meeting. We can just give you the list of people

7551
09:28:22,440 --> 09:28:27,160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and we can confirm if the meeting actually took place.

7552
09:28:27,900 --> 09:28:32,340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: I personally, this representation will help the Honorable San Fernando confirm this also.

7553
09:28:32,940 --> 09:28:35,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7554
09:28:36,400 --> 09:28:43,320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mahalaga po na napag-uusapan natin ang bagay na ito, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7555
09:28:44,460 --> 09:28:52,320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dahil meron pong hindi malinaw sa proseso ng pagtatakda ng meeting.

7556
09:28:52,440 --> 09:29:01,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Minimum wage at may kalituhang nangyayari na idinulot ng Wage Order 28 at ng Wage Order 27.

7557
09:29:01,780 --> 09:29:12,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And it is surprising, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, na pati ang DepDev who sits as the ex-official vice chair of NWPC,

7558
09:29:13,800 --> 09:29:15,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mukha po silang clueless.

7559
09:29:16,900 --> 09:29:22,180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero kung binabanggit po ng butihing sponsor na magpoprovide ng mga dokumentasyon,

7560
09:29:22,440 --> 09:29:29,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na nagpapakita na merong naganap na pulong, gusto pong makita ng representasyong yan.

7561
09:29:29,620 --> 09:29:37,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At maraming salamat po sa sponsor na tinitiyak na magkakaroon tayo ng kopya ng nasabing pulong.

7562
09:29:38,340 --> 09:29:41,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But let it be put on record, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7563
09:29:42,840 --> 09:29:48,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na kahit po ang DepDev ay lito at hindi alam ang mga espesipikong detalye

7564
09:29:48,620 --> 09:29:52,420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng pagtitibay ng Wage Order 28,

7565
09:29:52,440 --> 09:29:57,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na bahagi ng kanilang responsibilidad at ng kanilang mandato.

7566
09:29:58,060 --> 09:29:58,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This is unacceptable.

7567
09:30:00,000 --> 09:30:05,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Proper time, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, kapag sumalang na po ang Department of Labor and Employment,

7568
09:30:06,360 --> 09:30:14,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sisingilin po natin ang kagawaran na yun, batay sa record at sinasabi ng DepDev ngayon sa deliberasyong ito.

7569
09:30:15,240 --> 09:30:17,540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Susunod po, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7570
09:30:19,340 --> 09:30:25,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi po ng Wage Order No. 28 kung saan pumirma ulit ang DepDev.

7571
09:30:25,100 --> 09:30:32,360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi po, Wage Order No. 27 never took effect.

7572
09:30:33,860 --> 09:30:36,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano pong kalukuhan ito, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor?

7573
09:30:37,660 --> 09:30:44,540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Is it the position of DepDev to say that Wage Order No. 27 never took effect?

7574
09:30:45,120 --> 09:30:47,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi pumirma po sila, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7575
09:30:55,100 --> 09:31:09,920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, as for the DepDev, the reason for the non-implementation of Wage Order No. 27 is because

7576
09:31:09,920 --> 09:31:15,880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: apparently there was a TRO that was issued the day before the meeting took place.

7577
09:31:15,880 --> 09:31:24,580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, non-implementation is different from the wording of Wage Order No. 28 which specifically say,

7578
09:31:25,100 --> 09:31:29,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Wage Order No. 27 never took effect.

7579
09:31:30,260 --> 09:31:32,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: What does that mean in popular parlance?

7580
09:31:33,040 --> 09:31:37,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang ibig sabihin po niyan, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, sinasabi ng Regional Wage Board

7581
09:31:37,560 --> 09:31:40,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na hindi naman nangyari yung dagdag sahod na P85.

7582
09:31:42,760 --> 09:31:45,540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Never took effect. Hindi nangyari.

7583
09:31:46,860 --> 09:31:53,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But it was the Secretary of the Department of Labor and Employment who announced it as historic wage increase.

7584
09:31:54,300 --> 09:31:54,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, my friends...

7585
09:31:55,100 --> 09:32:04,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question again is, is it the position of the DepDev to say that Wage Order No. 27 never took effect?

7586
09:32:13,240 --> 09:32:17,660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, on the part of DepDev, apparently this was a collegial decision.

7587
09:32:18,820 --> 09:32:22,520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: It was a collegial, but they signed. DepDev signed. So, it is the position.

7588
09:32:23,040 --> 09:32:24,180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: It's answerable by yes or no.

7589
09:32:24,260 --> 09:32:25,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay lang kung...

7590
09:32:25,020 --> 09:32:26,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yun ang position ng DepDev, Madam Sponsor.

7591
09:32:27,140 --> 09:32:28,560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: In the function of that, yes, Madam Sponsor.

7592
09:32:28,560 --> 09:32:35,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes. So, it is the position of DepDev to say that Wage Order No. 27 never took effect.

7593
09:32:35,960 --> 09:32:40,400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Chapter 3, Section 4, IRR of RA 6727.

7594
09:32:41,420 --> 09:32:48,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 15 days upon the publication of any wage order, that wage order shall take effect.

7595
09:32:49,020 --> 09:32:49,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Question.

7596
09:32:50,620 --> 09:32:52,520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na-publish ba yung Wage Order No. 27?

7597
09:32:52,940 --> 09:32:54,060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The answer is yes.

7598
09:32:55,020 --> 09:32:56,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na-isa publiko ba?

7599
09:32:56,360 --> 09:32:57,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The answer is yes.

7600
09:32:58,220 --> 09:33:01,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thirdly, na-i-announce ba ng mismong kalihim ng DOLE?

7601
09:33:01,800 --> 09:33:02,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The answer is yes.

7602
09:33:03,340 --> 09:33:08,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Why is it the position of DepDev to say that Wage Order No. 27 never took effect?

7603
09:33:15,200 --> 09:33:16,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Never took [unclear].

7604
09:33:16,460 --> 09:33:19,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The problem is, nagcirculate [unclear].

7605
09:33:38,480 --> 09:33:42,260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, on the part of DepDev, it's really the TRO.

7606
09:33:43,060 --> 09:33:45,940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Apparently, there was a declaration also of the status quo ante.

7607
09:33:47,280 --> 09:33:48,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, it's because of the TRO.

7608
09:33:49,920 --> 09:33:51,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes. Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7609
09:33:51,780 --> 09:33:54,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: if I may remind, DepDev,

7610
09:33:55,020 --> 09:34:00,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: there was an order coming from Pasig RTC Branch 152.

7611
09:34:00,380 --> 09:34:02,940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And the order explicitly say,

7612
09:34:04,120 --> 09:34:12,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: let a preliminary injunction be issued upon putting up a bond of 10 billion pesos.

7613
09:34:13,460 --> 09:34:17,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In the previous DOLE budget consideration in the committee,

7614
09:34:18,040 --> 09:34:19,280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker,

7615
09:34:19,280 --> 09:34:23,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it was the Department of Labor and Employment Secretary himself who said,

7616
09:34:24,400 --> 09:34:25,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: he doesn't know.

7617
09:34:25,020 --> 09:34:27,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Meaning, walang nalagay na bond.

7618
09:34:28,620 --> 09:34:32,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, if there is no bond, then there is no injunction.

7619
09:34:33,480 --> 09:34:37,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The rules of court is very specific about this.

7620
09:34:38,660 --> 09:34:41,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, without a bond, walang preliminary injunction.

7621
09:34:42,960 --> 09:34:46,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Indispensable requirement ng preliminary injunction ang bond.

7622
09:34:48,240 --> 09:34:49,580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, wala pong nailagak na bond.

7623
09:34:50,400 --> 09:34:51,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Therefore, there is no injunction.

7624
09:34:51,600 --> 09:34:53,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: If there is no injunction,

7625
09:34:53,660 --> 09:34:55,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it is the position of the office,

7626
09:34:55,020 --> 09:34:56,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: the office of the Solicitor General,

7627
09:34:56,980 --> 09:34:58,280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: abogado ng gobyerno,

7628
09:34:58,760 --> 09:34:59,580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na sinasabi nila,

7629
09:35:00,020 --> 09:35:06,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: there is no legal impediment in enforcing Wage Order No. 27.

7630
09:35:06,660 --> 09:35:08,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question again is,

7631
09:35:08,600 --> 09:35:12,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: even if that is very clear sa ating mga batas,

7632
09:35:13,000 --> 09:35:19,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: why is it the position of DepDev to say that Wage Order No. 27 never took effect?

7633
09:35:25,020 --> 09:35:29,900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, again, just on the part of DepDev,

7634
09:35:30,060 --> 09:35:31,380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it was a collegial decision.

7635
09:35:32,820 --> 09:35:34,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7636
09:35:36,360 --> 09:35:39,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang punto ko po, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7637
09:35:41,380 --> 09:35:44,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa dinami-rami ko pong binanggit ng mga puntos,

7638
09:35:44,980 --> 09:35:47,860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mismong DepDev na bahagi ng NWPC

7639
09:35:47,860 --> 09:35:52,500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ay lito, una, sa mga tunay na nangyari at naganap

7640
09:35:52,500 --> 09:35:54,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: leading to the issuance of Wage Order No. 27.

7641
09:35:55,020 --> 09:36:00,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mas nalito pa tayo lahat dahil may existing Wage Order No. 27

7642
09:36:00,480 --> 09:36:03,420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at naglabas ng panibagong Wage Order No. 28

7643
09:36:03,420 --> 09:36:07,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kahit labag ito sa rules mismo ng NWPC.

7644
09:36:07,760 --> 09:36:10,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Second point, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker,

7645
09:36:10,600 --> 09:36:12,320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi nagkaroon ng public consultation.

7646
09:36:13,000 --> 09:36:17,280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Third point, hindi rin nagkaroon ng meeting ang NWPC

7647
09:36:17,280 --> 09:36:20,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para pagtibayin yung Wage Order No. 28.

7648
09:36:21,320 --> 09:36:23,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero binabanggit kanina, nagkaroon daw ng pulong,

7649
09:36:23,880 --> 09:36:24,980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pero hindi rin nilaman.

7650
09:36:25,020 --> 09:36:27,400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Malaman o matandaan saan sila nagpulong,

7651
09:36:27,520 --> 09:36:29,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: anong oras sila nagpulong, at merong kalituhan.

7652
09:36:30,540 --> 09:36:32,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7653
09:36:32,600 --> 09:36:36,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mas nagbibigay ito ng maraming tanong kaysa kalinawan.

7654
09:36:37,440 --> 09:36:40,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya ako po binibigyang din ito, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7655
09:36:41,300 --> 09:36:44,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: malinaw po kasi na merong wage rollback na nangyari.

7656
09:36:45,200 --> 09:36:50,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Wage Order No. 27, total wage increase amounts to P85.

7657
09:36:51,180 --> 09:36:55,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: P60 of which, the first tranche,

7658
09:36:55,860 --> 09:36:57,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: effective na since July 25.

7659
09:36:58,480 --> 09:37:01,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That means, kapag in-implement yung Wage Order No. 27,

7660
09:37:02,640 --> 09:37:06,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: may retroactive pay ang mga manggagawang minimum wage earner

7661
09:37:06,140 --> 09:37:09,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng P60 starting July 25.

7662
09:37:10,580 --> 09:37:16,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, pumapatak ang metro, mahigit P3,000 na ang naaagaw mula sa mga manggagawa.

7663
09:37:16,440 --> 09:37:17,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi po simpleng halaga yan.

7664
09:37:18,140 --> 09:37:21,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Malaking tulong yan para sa mga manggagawa, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7665
09:37:21,720 --> 09:37:24,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, sa halip na tindigan,

7666
09:37:25,020 --> 09:37:29,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng NWPC, ng DOLE, kung ano yung kanyang mandato,

7667
09:37:29,600 --> 09:37:33,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil iginawad yan ng Kongreso sa visa ng RA 6727,

7668
09:37:35,080 --> 09:37:39,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nakikita po natin na parang isinasantabi o isinusuko

7669
09:37:39,780 --> 09:37:43,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng NWPC mismo kung saan pahagi ang DepDev,

7670
09:37:44,220 --> 09:37:46,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung kanyang responsibilidad at trabaho

7671
09:37:46,600 --> 09:37:53,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: bilang merong exclusive jurisdiction on wage determination.

7672
09:37:55,020 --> 09:37:57,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yun po ang punto dito, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7673
09:37:58,600 --> 09:38:01,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mas malaking problema, because of Wage Order No. 28,

7674
09:38:02,440 --> 09:38:06,220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: wala nang aasahan na retroactive pay yung mga manggagawa

7675
09:38:06,220 --> 09:38:09,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: unless otherwise clarified and cleared by the court.

7676
09:38:11,100 --> 09:38:13,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang problema pa dito, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7677
09:38:14,220 --> 09:38:15,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: because of Wage Order No. 28,

7678
09:38:16,280 --> 09:38:20,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na wala na yung dagdag na P25 sa mga minimum wage earners

7679
09:38:20,480 --> 09:38:23,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na dapat matanggap nila Enero 2027.

7680
09:38:23,900 --> 09:38:27,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And it will produce another question.

7681
09:38:28,140 --> 09:38:32,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kung ang posisyon ng NWPC ay para magkaroon ng inovasyon

7682
09:38:32,660 --> 09:38:35,040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: maibigay na sa mga manggagawa, yung P60,

7683
09:38:35,640 --> 09:38:38,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ibig sabihin ba magkakaroon ng Wage Order No. 29?

7684
09:38:40,080 --> 09:38:44,820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na magsasabi, magdagdag tayo ng panibagong P25

7685
09:38:44,820 --> 09:38:47,320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para sa mga minimum wage earners.

7686
09:38:47,700 --> 09:38:51,400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: E di-veniolate na, nilabag na ng NWPC

7687
09:38:51,400 --> 09:38:53,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung kanyang sariling rules.

7688
09:38:53,900 --> 09:38:57,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Naglabas ng dalawang wage order sa isang taon

7689
09:38:57,380 --> 09:39:00,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at ngayon may question kung maglalabas ulit ng panibagong wage order.

7690
09:39:01,960 --> 09:39:04,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yun po ang punto dito, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7691
09:39:05,440 --> 09:39:08,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mismong mga regional wage boards, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker,

7692
09:39:09,240 --> 09:39:12,220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ay hindi sumusunod sa mga proseso ng batas

7693
09:39:12,220 --> 09:39:19,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na ginawa para itakda yung minimum wage natatanggap ng mga manggagawa

7694
09:39:19,020 --> 09:39:20,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at yan po yung dahilan.

7695
09:39:20,140 --> 09:39:21,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mga manggagawa na tayo,

7696
09:39:22,200 --> 09:39:23,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: una, hindi nang-responsive,

7697
09:39:23,900 --> 09:39:25,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa pangangailangan ng mga manggagawa.

7698
09:39:26,200 --> 09:39:30,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ikalawa, nilalabag pa mismo ng mga ahensa ng gobyerno

7699
09:39:30,100 --> 09:39:31,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung ano nakasulat sa batas.

7700
09:39:32,580 --> 09:39:34,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kung hindi nasusunod ang batas,

7701
09:39:34,840 --> 09:39:39,060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: logical lang na dapat reviewhin o repasuhin ang batas.

7702
09:39:39,780 --> 09:39:43,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon po, kung nakikita natin na may kaguluhan na nagaganap

7703
09:39:43,700 --> 09:39:46,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dito sa wage setting determination natin

7704
09:39:46,440 --> 09:39:49,040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as enshrined in RA 6727,

7705
09:39:49,800 --> 09:39:52,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nakakapagtaka po, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker,

7706
09:39:52,340 --> 09:39:53,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: that the position,

7707
09:39:53,900 --> 09:39:56,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: of the Secretary of Dep-Def,

7708
09:39:57,240 --> 09:39:58,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sabi po ay,

7709
09:39:58,680 --> 09:40:00,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: legislating a minimum wage

7710
09:40:00,960 --> 09:40:03,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: is not the right thing to do.

7711
09:40:04,840 --> 09:40:07,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Papaano pong bibigyang matwid ng Dep-Def

7712
09:40:07,760 --> 09:40:10,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na hindi tama ang pagle-legislate

7713
09:40:10,560 --> 09:40:12,420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng minimum wage

7714
09:40:12,420 --> 09:40:14,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung nakikita na natin ngayon

7715
09:40:14,480 --> 09:40:17,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na malaki ang problema sa mga regional wage boards?

7716
09:40:18,280 --> 09:40:20,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: If we're going back to our history,

7717
09:40:21,100 --> 09:40:22,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: bakit nagkaroon ng RA 6727

7718
09:40:23,900 --> 09:40:27,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pinoproteksyonan niya yung wage setting mechanism?

7719
09:40:27,880 --> 09:40:29,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi nung mga nagtulak niyan,

7720
09:40:29,420 --> 09:40:32,180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kailangan ma-insulate natin,

7721
09:40:32,560 --> 09:40:35,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mailayo natin mula sa awayan sa politika

7722
09:40:35,600 --> 09:40:36,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: o pamumulitika

7723
09:40:36,720 --> 09:40:39,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: o pangingi-alam ng korte

7724
09:40:39,380 --> 09:40:41,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung wage setting determination natin.

7725
09:40:42,120 --> 09:40:43,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That was in 1989.

7726
09:40:45,100 --> 09:40:48,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7727
09:40:48,960 --> 09:40:51,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nakikita na natin lahat ng kinatatakutan

7728
09:40:51,840 --> 09:40:53,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng mga gumawa ng batas noong 1989.

7729
09:40:53,900 --> 09:40:54,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ngayon, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7730
09:40:54,700 --> 09:40:56,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na ang niyayari na ngayon.

7731
09:40:57,760 --> 09:40:59,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pinanghimasukan ng korte

7732
09:40:59,080 --> 09:41:01,360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung tungkol sa sahod

7733
09:41:01,360 --> 09:41:04,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at ikalawa, nilalabag na mismo ng gobyerno

7734
09:41:04,660 --> 09:41:06,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung ano ang nakasulat sa batas

7735
09:41:06,600 --> 09:41:08,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na iginawad ng kongresong ito

7736
09:41:08,800 --> 09:41:12,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: papunta doon sa National Wages and Productivity Commission.

7737
09:41:12,840 --> 09:41:14,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And what we're going to hear

7738
09:41:14,160 --> 09:41:17,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: from Secretary Balisakan and Dep-Dev

7739
09:41:17,000 --> 09:41:19,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: is that legislating a minimum wage

7740
09:41:19,900 --> 09:41:21,520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: is not the right thing to do.

7741
09:41:22,440 --> 09:41:23,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Is it still the position of the government?

7742
09:41:23,800 --> 09:41:24,400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Is it still the position of Dep-Dev

7743
09:41:24,400 --> 09:41:28,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na hindi po magkaroon ng legislated wage increase

7744
09:41:28,640 --> 09:41:33,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: or any review on RA 6727

7745
09:41:33,720 --> 09:41:38,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: which determines and defines wage-setting mechanism?

7746
09:41:39,400 --> 09:41:40,580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

7747
09:41:42,100 --> 09:41:45,240
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to remind Representative San Fernando

7748
09:41:45,240 --> 09:41:46,240
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: that his time has expired.

7749
09:41:47,460 --> 09:41:50,220
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Please answer, Madam Sponsor.

7750
09:41:50,340 --> 09:41:51,420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, thank you, Madam Speaker.

7751
09:41:51,420 --> 09:41:53,640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: At least on the part of Dep-Dev,

7752
09:41:53,800 --> 09:41:57,500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the Dep-Dev will just adhere to what the law says

7753
09:41:57,500 --> 09:42:00,820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with regards to wages

7754
09:42:00,820 --> 09:42:02,520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and determination of wages.

7755
09:42:04,000 --> 09:42:06,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The Dep-Dev will just...

7756
09:42:06,200 --> 09:42:08,220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Can you repeat that, Madam Sponsor, Madam Speaker?

7757
09:42:09,220 --> 09:42:12,400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It would adhere to what the law prescribed

7758
09:42:12,400 --> 09:42:15,020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with regards to determination of wages.

7759
09:42:15,460 --> 09:42:17,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7760
09:42:17,820 --> 09:42:20,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as much as I would like to believe that,

7761
09:42:20,800 --> 09:42:23,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: alam niyo po, kanina ko pa po pinaulit-ulit,

7762
09:42:23,800 --> 09:42:26,500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mga batas na po mismo na dapat nilang sundin,

7763
09:42:26,600 --> 09:42:27,420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi nila ginagawa.

7764
09:42:28,700 --> 09:42:31,320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mga batas na nakasulat sa ating...

7765
09:42:31,320 --> 09:42:33,900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na iginawad sa kanila ng kongresyong ito,

7766
09:42:34,120 --> 09:42:35,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi nila ginagawa.

7767
09:42:35,480 --> 09:42:36,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tapos sasabihin nila sa atin ngayon,

7768
09:42:37,040 --> 09:42:38,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

7769
09:42:39,000 --> 09:42:41,180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gagalangin nila kung ano nakasulat sa batas.

7770
09:42:41,500 --> 09:42:43,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano ba namang clashing Dep-Dev yan?

7771
09:42:43,500 --> 09:42:45,060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7772
09:42:46,000 --> 09:42:47,660
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Thank you, Representative San Fernando.

7773
09:42:47,780 --> 09:42:50,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So alam ko po, time's up na po ako, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

7774
09:42:50,800 --> 09:42:51,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po.

7775
09:42:51,680 --> 09:42:53,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At least nabigyan po ng kalinawan,

7776
09:42:54,220 --> 09:42:55,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang representasyong ito,

7777
09:42:55,900 --> 09:42:58,860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at sa lahat po ng mga manggagawang minimum wage earner

7778
09:42:58,860 --> 09:43:01,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa NCR at sa buong Pilipinas,

7779
09:43:01,580 --> 09:43:03,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ito po ang mga economic managers natin.

7780
09:43:04,080 --> 09:43:06,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Puro kalituhan ang ginagawa sa mga manggagawang.

7781
09:43:06,260 --> 09:43:06,940
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

7782
09:43:07,160 --> 09:43:07,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Salamat po.

7783
09:43:09,900 --> 09:43:11,620
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, may we recognize

7784
09:43:11,620 --> 09:43:13,680
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: the Honorable Sarah Jane Elago

7785
09:43:13,680 --> 09:43:16,020
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: of the Gabriela Women's Party List

7786
09:43:16,020 --> 09:43:17,520
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: for her interpellation.

7787
09:43:18,040 --> 09:43:19,780
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Sarah Jane Elago

7788
09:43:19,780 --> 09:43:20,920
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: of Gabriela Party List

7789
09:43:20,920 --> 09:43:23,040
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: is now recognized for her interpellation.

7790
09:43:23,800 --> 09:43:28,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

7791
